1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,400
 Hi, in this lesson, I will talk about what personal data chat GPT process and how it is used.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,880
 Let's get started.

3
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:11,280
 Get GPT processes several types of personal data.

4
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:17,520
 This includes your account information, such as your name, contact details, login information,

5
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:20,920
 payment methods and records of your transactions.

6
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:23,760
 It also includes the content you create or share.

7
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:28,720
 Like the prompts you type in, the files, images or audio you upload,

8
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:31,200
 as well as any feedback you provide.

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:38,000
 Additionally, chat GPT processes, communication details, for example, messages you send through email

10
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,360
 or social media, along with any compact information you share in those messages.

11
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:50,400
 There is also technical and logged data, such as your IP address, browser type, device details,

12
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:54,240
 usage logs, time stamps and records of your interactions.

13
00:00:54,800 --> 00:01:00,400
 Finally, any extra information you provide, such as response to surveys, proof of identity

14
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:04,000
 or demographic information, may also be processed.

15
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,840
 Now, does chat GPT use your content or code for training?

16
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:09,840
 Was the consumer version of the service?

17
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:10,880
 Yes.

18
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:16,800
 By default, chat GPT may use the inputs you share and the feedback you give to help

19
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:18,560
 improve the models.

20
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:23,440
 However, if you are using the API, a paid plan or enterprise services,

21
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:29,840
 open AI does not use your submitted data for training unless you explicitly choose to opt in.

22
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:34,480
 You also have controls in your settings that allow you to disable your data

23
00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:37,680
 from being used for training in certain cases.

24
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:40,240
 How does chat GPT use your data?

25
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:43,760
 It is used to provide, maintain and improve the service,

26
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:47,200
 making sure it performs well and remains secure.

27
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:51,920
 It is also used to detect abuse, fraud or misuse of the system,

28
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:54,240
 and to enforce the service policies.

29
00:01:54,240 --> 00:02:00,880
 Your data may be used for customer support, sending you updates, alerts and notifications.

30
00:02:00,880 --> 00:02:05,760
 In some cases, if your data is included in training, it helps with research,

31
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:08,560
 model development and safety improvements.

32
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:13,920
 And finally, data may be processed when needed to comply with the law,

33
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:18,000
 legal processes, or to help resolve disputes.

34
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,680
 How long is your data retained?

35
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:26,080
 If you delete the conversation, it is normally kept for 30 days before being fully removed.

36
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:32,880
 Log data and usage records are stored for a long as needed to ensure proper service,

37
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:35,600
 security and to meet legal requirements.

38
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:40,880
 Feedback and training data are retained based on internal policies

39
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:43,520
 and the purpose for which they were collected.

40
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:46,240
 Does chat GPT share your data with third parties?

41
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:53,440
 Yes, but only with trusted service providers, such as cloud hosting and infrastructure partners.

42
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:57,520
 And this is always done under strict confidentiality agreements.

43
00:02:57,520 --> 00:03:04,480
 Your personal data is not sold and your content is not shared for marketing or advertising purposes.

44
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:10,880
 Access to your data is tightly controlled and only given to authorized staff who needed to do their job.

45
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:15,200
 I hope this lesson was useful for you and see you in the next lesson.

